      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Thanks for the m2e bit.</p>\n\n<p>I added the wagon-gitsite snapshot because 0.3.1 doesn't work anymore--not sure why, but the issue is noted here <a href=\"https://github.com/khuxtable/wagon-gitsite/pull/13\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/khuxtable/wagon-gitsite/pull/13</a>. Not sure what the right solution is for this short of pushing a forked release of the plugin to a Maven repo.</p>",
     "created": "08/Feb/12 11:25 PM",
