      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Hmm...0.3.1 has worked for me for fcrepo-misc (a multi-module project) for a while:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://cwilper.github.com/fcrepo-misc/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://cwilper.github.com/fcrepo-misc/</a></p>\n\n<p>With fcrepo-misc's pom, the following steps have worked for me to deploy:</p>\n\n<p>git checkout v0.1.1 (whatever the just-tagged version is)<br/>\nmvn site-deploy -P release-site<br/>\ngit checkout master<br/>\ngit pull</p>",
